 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]u" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364500 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535745 true] [17592186364500 1111 #uuid "b15b9e36-afe7-5769-90b3-e6f164d4ef0c" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364501 1017 #edb/ref 17592186364502 13194139535745 true] [17592186364501 1089 "q-335207" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364501 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535745 true] [17592186364501 1100 "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=3x(t)-y(t)+5 \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=2x(t)+y(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the system of ODEs above. The equilibrium point of the system is $[-1,\\,2]^{T}.$ Which of the following is the system obtained by shifting the equilibrium to the origin?" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364501 1113 #uuid "c89cb551-d1e6-5832-a074-6afc9561ced3" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364501 1145 "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]x+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nwhere $x=[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}].$\n\nTo shift the system's equilibrium from ${x}^{∗}$ to the origin, we define the deviation vector\n\n$$\nu=x-{x}^{∗},\n$$\n\nwhere $u=[\\begin{aligned}u(t) \\\\ v(t)\\end{aligned}].$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\nu=x-[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\,⇒\\,x=u+[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\,\\text{and}\\,{x}^{′}={u}^{′}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x$ and ${x}^{′}$ into the given system, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′} & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]x+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {u}^{′} & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}](u+[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}])+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]u+[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]u+[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the shifted system is the following:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(t)=3u(t)-v(t) \\\\ {v}^{′}(t)=2u(t)+v(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364502 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364503 13194139535745 true] [17592186364502 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364504 13194139535745 true] [17592186364502 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364505 13194139535745 true] [17592186364502 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364506 13194139535745 true] [17592186364502 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364507 13194139535745 true] [17592186364502 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535745 true] [17592186364502 1041 "selection" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364502 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364505 13194139535745 true] [17592186364502 1110 #uuid "33cc2c1f-6ccb-5b67-83ba-b364765306c8" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364503 1034 "{\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(t)=3u(t)-v(t)-1 \\\\ {v}^{′}(t)=2u(t)+v(t)+2\\end{aligned}" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364503 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535745 true] [17592186364503 1111 #uuid "739ca367-6dc8-5f21-bd75-0cb90375c1f5" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364504 1034 "{\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(t)=3u(t) \\\\ {v}^{′}(t)=v(t)\\end{aligned}" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364504 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535745 true] [17592186364504 1111 #uuid "9c3906ee-3ab9-559a-815b-f0505e130ead" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364505 1034 "{\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(t)=3u(t)-v(t) \\\\ {v}^{′}(t)=2u(t)+v(t)\\end{aligned}" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364505 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535745 true] [17592186364505 1111 #uuid "029b8c47-ff2a-569b-9948-76e2b4305751" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364506 1034 "{\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(t)=3u(t) \\\\ {v}^{′}(t)=2v(t)\\end{aligned}" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364506 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535745 true] [17592186364506 1111 #uuid "f7533251-0e92-5a0f-b6d1-97ec22af0f0d" 13194139535745 true] [