{aligned}{y}^{′}(t) & =2x(t)-{y}^{2}(t)+8y(t)-10 \\\\ {v}^{′}(t) & =2(u(t)-1)-(v(t)+2)^{2}+8(v(t)+2)-10 \\\\  & =2u(t)-2-({v}^{2}(t)+4v(t)+4)+8v(t)+16-10 \\\\  & =2u(t)-{v}^{2}(t)+4v(t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the shifted system is the following:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(t)={u}^{2}(t)+2u(t)+v(t) \\\\ {v}^{′}(t)=2u(t)-{v}^{2}(t)+4v(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364538 13194139535745 true] [17592186364537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364539 13194139535745 true] [17592186364537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364540 13194139535745 true] [17592186364537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364541 13194139535745 true] [17592186364537 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364542 13194139535745 true] [17592186364537 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535745 true] [17592186364537 1041 "selection" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364537 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364541 13194139535745 true] [17592186364537 1110 #uuid "c49f71d1-d62a-54ed-b247-f377b497850b" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364538 1034 "{\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(t)=2{u}^{2}(t)+2u(t)+v(t) \\\\ {v}^{′}(t)=2u(t)-2{v}^{2}(t)+4v(t)\\end{aligned}" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364538 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535745 true] [17592186364538 1111 #uuid "b1b6e477-ee48-59cc-984f-c7d8564f93d0" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364539 1034 "{\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(t)=2u(t)+v(t) \\\\ {v}^{′}(t)=2{u}^{2}(t)-{v}^{2}(t)+4v(t)\\end{aligned}" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364539 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535745 true] [17592186364539 1111 #uuid "0a8d7b1e-f9f7-5cbd-8331-b5fd992f97a5" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364540 1034 "{\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(t)={u}^{2}(t)+2u(t)+{v}^{2}(t) \\\\ {v}^{′}(t)=2u(t)+4v(t)\\end{aligned}" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364540 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535745 true] [17592186364540 1111 #uuid "844b645b-fa5f-50c8-95ca-0b1af1175158" 13194139535745 true] [17592186364541 1034 "{\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(t)={u}^{2}(t)+2u(t)+v(t) \\\\ {v}^{′}(t)=2u(t)-{v}^{2}(t)+4v(t)\\e